# Fase 0: docs de estado/agentes SIEMPRE trackeados (override *.md linea 111)
!PROJECT_STATE.md
!AGENTS.md
!CLAUDE.md
!docs/**/*.md
!.claude/settings.json
!.eslintrc.testid.json

# Z0B: spike docs + test fixtures are ALWAYS tracked (overrides *.md line 111 and *.json line 122).
# Without these negations `git add` drops them silently: the sanitizer suites import
# those JSON files, so a clean clone (CI) fails at import even while local runs stay green.
!scripts/spikes/**/*.md
!__tests__/**/fixtures/*.json
# Z0B-2: the webhook fixtures sit one level deeper (fixtures/webhooks/*.json), which the
# single-level negation above does NOT reach — confirmed with `git check-ignore` before use.
!__tests__/**/fixtures/**/*.json

# Z0B-2: raw webhook captures and Zoom API dumps hold real account/user ids and the host
# email. They are the INPUT to the redacted fixtures and are never committed themselves.
scripts/spikes/webhook/captures/
scripts/spikes/zoom/out/

# Playwright test artifacts
playwright-report/
